{"page":561,"width":1665,"height":2527,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"624","words":[{"text":"624","x":178,"y":143,"width":58,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 14 파일 시스템 구현","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":305,"y":144,"width":115,"height":26},{"text":"14","x":432,"y":145,"width":36,"height":21},{"text":"파일","x":496,"y":145,"width":40,"height":23},{"text":"시스템","x":545,"y":145,"width":62,"height":24},{"text":"구현","x":616,"y":145,"width":40,"height":24}]},{"text":"14.3.1 선형 리스트 LinearList","words":[{"text":"14.3.1","x":305,"y":265,"width":125,"height":30},{"text":"선형","x":471,"y":265,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"리스트","x":537,"y":265,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"LinearList","x":640,"y":274,"width":139,"height":21}]},{"text":"디렉터리를 구현하는 가장 간단한 빙뻡은 파일 이름과 데이터 블록에 대한 포인터들의","words":[{"text":"디렉터리를","x":306,"y":334,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"구현하는","x":471,"y":336,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"가장","x":604,"y":336,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"간단한","x":675,"y":336,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"빙뻡은","x":774,"y":336,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":876,"y":336,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"이름과","x":950,"y":336,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":1056,"y":337,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"블록에","x":1165,"y":337,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":1279,"y":336,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"포인터들의","x":1358,"y":335,"width":155,"height":36}]},{"text":"선형 리스트를 디렉터리에 시용하는 것이다. 이 방법은 프로그램이 쉽지만 실행 시간이","words":[{"text":"선형","x":306,"y":392,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"리스트를","x":380,"y":392,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터리에","x":513,"y":393,"width":143,"height":36},{"text":"시용하는","x":671,"y":394,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":802,"y":393,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":910,"y":394,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"방법은","x":952,"y":394,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램이","x":1058,"y":394,"width":156,"height":35},{"text":"쉽지만","x":1233,"y":393,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"실행","x":1346,"y":393,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시간이","x":1425,"y":392,"width":88,"height":37}]},{"text":"길다. 새로운 파일을 생성하기 위해서는 먼저 디렉터리를 탐색하여 같은 이름을 가진 파","words":[{"text":"길다.","x":307,"y":449,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":386,"y":450,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"파일을","x":488,"y":450,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"생성하기","x":589,"y":451,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"위해서는","x":717,"y":452,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"먼저","x":845,"y":451,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리를","x":916,"y":451,"width":152,"height":37},{"text":"탐색하여","x":1081,"y":451,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":1223,"y":451,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"이름을","x":1301,"y":451,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"가진","x":1412,"y":450,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"파","x":1486,"y":452,"width":31,"height":35}]},{"text":"일이 존재하지 않는다는 것을 확인한 후, 디렉터리의 끝부분에 새로운 항목을 첨가하면","words":[{"text":"일이","x":305,"y":508,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"존재하지","x":378,"y":507,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"않는다는","x":512,"y":508,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":643,"y":510,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"확인한","x":712,"y":510,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"후,","x":811,"y":510,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리의","x":863,"y":509,"width":146,"height":36},{"text":"끝부분에","x":1026,"y":510,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":1166,"y":509,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":1278,"y":509,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"첨가하면","x":1393,"y":509,"width":122,"height":36}]},{"text":"된다. 한 파일을 삭제하려면 디렉터리에서 이름을 찾아 그 파일에 할당된 공간을 방출한","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":304,"y":565,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":386,"y":565,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":427,"y":566,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"삭제하려면","x":528,"y":566,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"디렉터리에서","x":688,"y":568,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"이름을","x":874,"y":568,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"찾아","x":976,"y":568,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1049,"y":573,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"파일에","x":1092,"y":568,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"할당된","x":1201,"y":567,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"공간을","x":1312,"y":567,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"방출한","x":1424,"y":568,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"다. 디렉터리 항목을 재사용하기 위해 여러 가지 중 하니를 수행할 수 있다. 항목을 미사","words":[{"text":"다.","x":304,"y":625,"width":37,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":356,"y":624,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":488,"y":624,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"재사용하기","x":588,"y":625,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":745,"y":627,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"여러","x":815,"y":626,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":885,"y":626,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"중","x":954,"y":628,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"하니를","x":997,"y":626,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"수행할","x":1102,"y":626,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1211,"y":626,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1260,"y":626,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":1345,"y":626,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"미사","x":1457,"y":627,"width":60,"height":36}]},{"text":"용으로 표시하거나 또는 기용 디렉터리 항목 리스트에 추가할 수 있다. 미시용으로 표시","words":[{"text":"용으로","x":304,"y":684,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"표시하거나","x":408,"y":682,"width":149,"height":36},{"text":"또는","x":568,"y":685,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"기용","x":638,"y":684,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리","x":708,"y":685,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"항목","x":835,"y":685,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"리스트에","x":907,"y":685,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"추가할","x":1039,"y":685,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1146,"y":685,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1194,"y":684,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"미시용으로","x":1280,"y":685,"width":163,"height":35},{"text":"표시","x":1456,"y":686,"width":56,"height":36}]},{"text":"하는 방법에는 이름을 모두 공백으로 만든 것과 같은 특별한 이름을 정하거나 유효하지","words":[{"text":"하는","x":304,"y":742,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"방법에는","x":378,"y":741,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"이름을","x":512,"y":741,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"모두","x":610,"y":745,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"공백으로","x":680,"y":743,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"만든","x":810,"y":744,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"것과","x":882,"y":743,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":953,"y":743,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"특별한","x":1026,"y":744,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"이름을","x":1136,"y":744,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"정하거나","x":1247,"y":743,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"유효하지","x":1391,"y":744,"width":121,"height":36}]},{"text":"않은 inode 번호(예, 0)를 지정하거나 각 항목에 항목마다 시용-미시용 비트를 추가할","words":[{"text":"않은","x":304,"y":801,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"inode","x":377,"y":803,"width":87,"height":28},{"text":"번호(예,","x":480,"y":800,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"0)를","x":596,"y":803,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"지정하거나","x":668,"y":801,"width":145,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":825,"y":802,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"항목에","x":866,"y":802,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"항목마다","x":968,"y":802,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"시용-미시용","x":1107,"y":802,"width":191,"height":36},{"text":"비트를","x":1313,"y":802,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"추가할","x":1423,"y":803,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"수 있다. 세 번째 대안은 시용 기능하게 된 항목에 제일 마지막 항목을 복사해 넣고 디렉","words":[{"text":"수","x":302,"y":860,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":348,"y":859,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"세","x":427,"y":858,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"번째","x":469,"y":859,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"대안은","x":538,"y":859,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"시용","x":636,"y":859,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"기능하게","x":707,"y":859,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"된","x":834,"y":860,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"항목에","x":874,"y":860,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"제일","x":977,"y":861,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"마지막","x":1050,"y":861,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":1158,"y":860,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"복사해","x":1267,"y":861,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"넣고","x":1380,"y":861,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"디렉","x":1456,"y":861,"width":56,"height":36}]},{"text":"터리의 길이를 하나 줄이는 방법이다. 우리는 또한 파일 삭제 시간을 줄이기 위해 연결","words":[{"text":"터리의","x":304,"y":917,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"길이를","x":410,"y":917,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"하나","x":511,"y":917,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"줄이는","x":582,"y":917,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"방법이다.","x":683,"y":918,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"우리는","x":821,"y":919,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"또한","x":923,"y":919,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"파일","x":997,"y":919,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"삭제","x":1073,"y":920,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시간을","x":1152,"y":919,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"줄이기","x":1263,"y":919,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":1378,"y":919,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"연결","x":1457,"y":920,"width":55,"height":35}]},{"text":"리스트를 사용할 수도 있다.","words":[{"text":"리스트를","x":304,"y":976,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"사용할","x":437,"y":976,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"수도","x":535,"y":976,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":606,"y":976,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"선형 리스트로 구성된 디렉터리의 가장 큰 단점은 파일을 찾기 위해 선형 탐색을 해","words":[{"text":"선형","x":361,"y":1035,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"리스트로","x":435,"y":1035,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"구성된","x":562,"y":1035,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리의","x":663,"y":1036,"width":144,"height":36},{"text":"가장","x":822,"y":1037,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"큰","x":892,"y":1039,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"단점은","x":933,"y":1036,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"파일을","x":1036,"y":1037,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"찾기","x":1145,"y":1036,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":1222,"y":1036,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"선형","x":1302,"y":1036,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"탐색을","x":1379,"y":1036,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"해","x":1486,"y":1038,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"야 한다는 점이다. 디렉터리는 빈번하게 시용되고, 속도가 느리면 사용자는 이를 바로 느","words":[{"text":"야","x":302,"y":1094,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"한다는","x":344,"y":1094,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"점이다.","x":449,"y":1095,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리는","x":556,"y":1095,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"빈번하게","x":713,"y":1095,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"시용되고,","x":840,"y":1095,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"속도가","x":979,"y":1095,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"느리면","x":1084,"y":1095,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"사용자는","x":1193,"y":1094,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"이를","x":1338,"y":1094,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"바로","x":1412,"y":1095,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"느","x":1486,"y":1100,"width":29,"height":25}]},{"text":"낄 것이다. 실제 많은 운영체제는 가장 최근에 久卜옿된 디렉터리 정보를 저장하기 위해","words":[{"text":"낄","x":304,"y":1153,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":350,"y":1154,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"실제","x":464,"y":1154,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":536,"y":1154,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"운영체제는","x":607,"y":1153,"width":149,"height":36},{"text":"가장","x":770,"y":1154,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"최근에","x":843,"y":1154,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"久卜옿된","x":946,"y":1153,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1054,"y":1153,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"정보를","x":1198,"y":1152,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"저장하기","x":1313,"y":1153,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":1457,"y":1154,"width":56,"height":36}]},{"text":"소프트웨어 개시를 구현하고 있다. 개시 적중은 그 정보를 매번 보조저장장치로부터 읽","words":[{"text":"소프트웨어","x":301,"y":1213,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"개시를","x":469,"y":1213,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"구현하고","x":568,"y":1213,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":701,"y":1213,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"개시","x":780,"y":1213,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"적중은","x":852,"y":1213,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":953,"y":1217,"width":31,"height":23},{"text":"정보를","x":997,"y":1211,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"매번","x":1104,"y":1211,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"보조저장장치로부터","x":1181,"y":1211,"width":290,"height":36},{"text":"읽","x":1489,"y":1213,"width":23,"height":34}]},{"text":"어오는 것을 피할 수 있게 한다. 정렬된 리스트는 이진 탐색을 기능케 하며 평균 탐색 시","words":[{"text":"어오는","x":303,"y":1269,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":408,"y":1271,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"피할","x":478,"y":1271,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":546,"y":1272,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있게","x":589,"y":1271,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":656,"y":1272,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"정렬된","x":737,"y":1271,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"리스트는","x":838,"y":1271,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"이진","x":968,"y":1270,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"탐색을","x":1040,"y":1269,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"기능케","x":1148,"y":1269,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"하며","x":1258,"y":1269,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"평균","x":1337,"y":1269,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"탐색","x":1414,"y":1269,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"시","x":1488,"y":1271,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"간을 줄인다. 그렇지만, 리스트가 정렬 상태를 유지하려면 파일을 생성하거나 삭제하는","words":[{"text":"간을","x":301,"y":1328,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"줄인다.","x":376,"y":1329,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"그렇지만,","x":488,"y":1329,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"리스트가","x":630,"y":1329,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"정렬","x":760,"y":1329,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"상태를","x":831,"y":1329,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"유지하려면","x":933,"y":1328,"width":155,"height":34},{"text":"파일을","x":1104,"y":1327,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"생성하거나","x":1215,"y":1327,"width":165,"height":35},{"text":"삭제하는","x":1393,"y":1328,"width":124,"height":34}]},{"text":"일이 복잡해질 수 있다. 왜냐하면, 정렬을 유지하기 위해 상당한 정보를 이동해야 할 수","words":[{"text":"일이","x":303,"y":1385,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"복잡해질","x":374,"y":1387,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":507,"y":1388,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":551,"y":1387,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"왜냐하면,","x":629,"y":1386,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"정렬을","x":769,"y":1386,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"유지하기","x":869,"y":1385,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":